{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach and grasp visible object. If not found, scan area. Inspect grasped object if applicable. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GraspObject    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
